  "integrationNotes": [
    "Copy only selected audio files into public/audio. Do not copy originals, archives, tools.",
    "Title/menu/battle loop. Win/lose cues never loop.",
    "Use OGG, select MP3 fallback using canPlayType or fetch/decode failure. MP3 padding may require engine crossfade.",
    "Saber hit file already contains requested swish + metal + spark plus low thump. Do not layer a second copy.",
    "BGM gain values are per-event suggestions; apply BGM bus separately. SFX gain values are per-event suggestions; apply SFX bus separately.",
    "Missile fly is a short quiet one-shot intended once per launched missile, not every animation frame; apply distance attenuation and concurrency caps.",
    "No shield loop. Maintain a single BGM instance and cache pending request until gesture unlock."
  ]
